{"seq":3,"slug":"kg-question-answering","title":"知识图谱问答","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/knowledge-graphs/kg-reasoning/kg-question-answering","wordCount":886,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"知识图谱问答\">知识图谱问答</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>知识图谱问答（Knowledge Graph Question Answering, KGQA）是利用知识图谱中的结构化知识来回答自然语言问题的任务。用户提出自然语言问题，系统将问题转化为图谱查询或推理过程，从知识图谱中检索答案。KGQA 是知识图谱最直接的应用场景之一。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    Q[自然语言问题] --&gt; QU_K[问题理解]&#10;    QU_K --&gt; EL[实体链接]&#10;    QU_K --&gt; RL[关系链接]&#10;    EL --&gt; QUERY_GEN[查询生成]&#10;    RL --&gt; QUERY_GEN&#10;    QUERY_GEN --&gt; EXEC[查询执行]&#10;    EXEC --&gt; ANS[答案]&#10;    subgraph KGQA 管线&#10;        QU_K&#10;        EL&#10;        RL&#10;        QUERY_GEN&#10;        EXEC&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    Q[自然语言问题] --&gt; QU_K[问题理解]\n    QU_K --&gt; EL[实体链接]\n    QU_K --&gt; RL[关系链接]\n    EL --&gt; QUERY_GEN[查询生成]\n    RL --&gt; QUERY_GEN\n    QUERY_GEN --&gt; EXEC[查询执行]\n    EXEC --&gt; ANS[答案]\n    subgraph KGQA 管线\n        QU_K\n        EL\n        RL\n        QUERY_GEN\n        EXEC\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>KGQA 方法</th>\n<th>核心思路</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>劣势</th>\n<th>代表系统</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>语义解析</td>\n<td>问题→SPARQL/Cypher</td>\n<td>精确可解释</td>\n<td>需要标注数据</td>\n<td>QGG, ArcaneQA</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>信息检索</td>\n<td>子图检索+排序</td>\n<td>无需形式化查询</td>\n<td>可能不精确</td>\n<td>EmbedKGQA</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>嵌入推理</td>\n<td>向量空间推理</td>\n<td>支持多跳</td>\n<td>黑盒</td>\n<td>TransferNet</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LLM+KG</td>\n<td>LLM 推理+KG 验证</td>\n<td>灵活性高</td>\n<td>成本高</td>\n<td>ToG, StructGPT</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"语义解析方法\">语义解析方法</h2><p>语义解析（Semantic Parsing）将自然语言问题转化为形式化的图查询语言（如 SPARQL），然后在知识图谱上执行查询获取答案。这是最精确的 KGQA 方法。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface SemanticParseResult {&#10;  sparql: string;&#10;  entities: LinkedEntity[];&#10;  relations: LinkedRelation[];&#10;  confidence: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface LinkedEntity {&#10;  mention: string;&#10;  kgId: string;&#10;  label: string;&#10;  score: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface LinkedRelation {&#10;  mention: string;&#10;  kgId: string;&#10;  label: string;&#10;  score: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function questionToSPARQL(question: string, entities: LinkedEntity[], relations: LinkedRelation[]): string {&#10;  const questionType = classifyQuestionType(question);&#10;&#10;  if (questionType === &#39;count&#39;) {&#10;    return `SELECT (COUNT(?x) AS ?count) WHERE { &lt;${entities[0].kgId}&gt; &lt;${relations[0].kgId}&gt; ?x . }`;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  if (questionType === &#39;boolean&#39;) {&#10;    return `ASK WHERE { &lt;${entities[0].kgId}&gt; &lt;${relations[0].kgId}&gt; &lt;${entities[1].kgId}&gt; . }`;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return `SELECT ?answer WHERE { &lt;${entities[0].kgId}&gt; &lt;${relations[0].kgId}&gt; ?answer . } LIMIT 10`;&#10;}&#10;&#10;type QuestionType = &#39;factoid&#39; | &#39;count&#39; | &#39;boolean&#39; | &#39;list&#39; | &#39;comparison&#39;;&#10;&#10;function classifyQuestionType(question: string): QuestionType {&#10;  if (question.includes(&#39;多少&#39;) || question.includes(&#39;几个&#39;)) return &#39;count&#39;;&#10;  if (question.includes(&#39;是否&#39;) || question.includes(&#39;是不是&#39;)) return &#39;boolean&#39;;&#10;  if (question.includes(&#39;哪些&#39;) || question.includes(&#39;列出&#39;)) return &#39;list&#39;;&#10;  if (question.includes(&#39;比较&#39;) || question.includes(&#39;更&#39;)) return &#39;comparison&#39;;&#10;  return &#39;factoid&#39;;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SemanticParseResult</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"